Eduka-Pastel is the Orchis GTK theme (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Orchis-theme)
by vinceliuice with Edukasaun colors: mint green accent (#3FA684), soft mint
surfaces instead of the grey ones and a softer orange for warnings, green light
variant (-t green), 14 px corners. Built with
Orchis' install.sh (sassc) after changing src/_sass/_color-palette-default.scss.
Licensed under the GNU GPL version 3 (see COPYING). The xfwm4 and openbox-3
window borders are generated by tools/gen-wm-themes.py with the same colors.
